  "sentences": [
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp5_1",
      "text": "很多人不知道，运动对睡觉也有很大的帮助。",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 4320,
      "durationMs": 4320,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p5_sp5_1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp5_2",
      "text": "常常运动的人，晚上很容易睡着，而且睡得非常好。",
      "startMs": 4320,
      "endMs": 9560,
      "durationMs": 5240,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p5_sp5_2.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp5_3",
      "text": "但是，运动的时间很重要。",
      "startMs": 9560,
      "endMs": 12907,
      "durationMs": 3347,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p5_sp5_3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp5_4",
      "text": "如果你晚上很晚才运动，可能会睡不着。",
      "startMs": 12907,
      "endMs": 17440,
      "durationMs": 4533,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p5_sp5_4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp5_5",
      "text": "因为运动以后，身体会变得很精神。",
      "startMs": 17440,
      "endMs": 21280,
      "durationMs": 3840,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p5_sp5_5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp5_6",
      "text": "所以，最好在白天或者下午运动。",
      "startMs": 21280,
      "endMs": 24907,
      "durationMs": 3627,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p5_sp5_6.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp5_7",
      "text": "如果你有睡觉的问题，可以试试每天下午去跑步。",
      "startMs": 24907,
      "endMs": 31200,
      "durationMs": 6293,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p5_sp5_7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp5_8",
      "text": "坚持几个星期以后，你会发现睡觉变简单了。",
      "startMs": 31200,
      "endMs": 37200,
      "durationMs": 6000,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p5_sp5_8.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp5_9",
      "text": "好的睡觉习惯对身体很重要，加上每天运动，你的身体和精神都会越来越好。",
      "startMs": 37200,
      "endMs": 46000,
      "durationMs": 8800,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p5_sp5_9.mp3"
    }
  ]
}